WEBVTT

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.950
Should we hunt goblins today?

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:43.450
Can you use magic?

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.370
We're looking for a temporary party member.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.620
Quest finished! Let's drink!

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.370
Please help!

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.870
My village is being attacked by a black viper!

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.870
Is it really a black viper?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.200
Not a normal one?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:12.290
How could a <i>normal </i>large snake swallow
livestock and adults in one gulp?!

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:21.500
I am very sorry, but we cannot accept
such a request at the current time.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.660
Why? I have money!

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.620
I collected all the money in the village!

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.410
If it's not enough, I'll do anything
to make up the difference!

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:30.790
None.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.040
We have no adventurers
that can take that quest.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.950
Wait! Then who are they?!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:40.410
All adventurers ranked high enough to
defeat a black viper are currently away.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:43.120
We have no idea when they will return.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.910
Of course, I will try to contact them immediately.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.160
We could request our lord
to send out an expedition,

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.500
but we would need days of preparation.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.790
Everyone in the village will
be eaten if we wait that long!

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.540
Anyone! Is there anyone who can help?!

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.080
You should go.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.000
It's impossible for me!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.910
If only Mr. Deborane was here...

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.620
Shit! Shit!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.450
What am I supposed to tell
everyone back at the village?!

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:14.040
Want me to go?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.040
My name is Yuna.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.040
So, where's your village?

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.910
Time to start the game.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.000
"Bear, Appears"

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.000
So, Miss Helen.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.160
Is the village in question far from Crimonia?

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.330
It's about a day and a half away
if you run a horse southeast.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.410
I don't really get how far away
something is based on horses.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.000
Well, whatever.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.700
I guess I'll head over there.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.000
Please wait!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.660
A black viper can grow
as long as 50 meters!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.120
It's difficult even for
higher-ranking adventurers!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.160
The village is in danger, right?

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.120
Plus, I've never seen
a black viper before.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.200
Are you making fun of me?!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.950
There's no way someone dressed so
stupidly could defeat a black viper!

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.450
Well, that's what anyone
would normally think...

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:29.790
Putting aside how you dress, a black viper
is impossible even for you, Miss Yuna.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.660
Then, what if I just go do some scouting?

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.330
Scouting?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.120
Yeah.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.450
I'll collect info on the monster,

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:42.160
then tell the high-ranking adventurers you
manage to contact so we can save time.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.620
I see. If that's the case...

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.290
If that will save the village...

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:55.910
Well, I might fight it if I get the chance, though.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.000
I understand.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.500
I'll contact the high-ranking adventurers
as quickly as possible.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.120
Please do not act recklessly.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.160
Yeah. I got it.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.160
A job, Miss Bear? Stay safe!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.040
Yeah. I'll be out for a bit.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.700
Hold on, Bear Sis.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:27.080
T-Take me with you.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.500
You'll just get in the way.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.200
I know...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.790
But I can at least guide you there.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.080
I'll show you the fastest way there!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:44.200
Well... I guess it's better to
get there as soon as possible.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.910
I'll leave you behind if you complain, kid.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.620
It's Kai! I'm not a kid!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.120
Did you come to Crimonia by horse?

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.290
Yeah.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:59.830
But I galloped here without letting
the horse rest, so it's exhausted.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.870
Well, I'm sure it won't be a problem for these two.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.750
"Summon Bear"

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.750
"You can summon one white and black bear using
the corresponding bear glove puppet."

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.790
Come on out, you two.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.080
Bear Sis summoned bears!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.580
What in the world are you?!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.870
I'm just an adventurer.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:23.540
These are my summon beasts,
so they aren't dangerous.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.790
Take care of me, Kumayuru.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.500
Let that kid ride you, Kumakyu.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.450
Don't sulk, Kumakyu.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:39.080
I'll make sure to ride on you, too.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.040
S-Sis.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.450
I've never ridden a bear before.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.500
It's fine.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:56.250
They're created so you won't fall off
even if you let go or sleep on them.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.120
Even if you tell me that...

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.700
Come on. Show me the way properly!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.870
Damn it! That way!

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.750
That way!

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.080
Well, let's take a small break.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.160
How far did we get?

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.410
About halfway already.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.620
You haven't slept at all, right?

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.290
Just tell me the direction and sleep.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:50.750
The only thing I can do is get you
to the village as soon as possible.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.250
You seem to have high expectations of me.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.660
Sorry for what I said at the guild.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:02.200
I'm sure you're an amazing adventurer
if you can summon beasts like these.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.290
I'm starting to feel like you really could
do something about the black viper.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.700
Huh? He's already showing his sweet side?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:14.580
It doesn't matter if I collapse as long
as I can get you to the village.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.910
The kids in this world are all so strong.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.620
But, well, if that's the case...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.700
...I'll ride you the rest of the way, Kumakyu.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.370
Now you take care of him, Kumayuru.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.660
This is...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.500
Hey, everyone!

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.160
It's me! It's Kai!

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.370
I'm back from Crimonia!

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.290
Every--!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.290
Don't be so loud.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.830
It's okay.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.370
There are people here.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.830
No large targets.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.830
Okay.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.790
Dad! Mom!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.040
Kai?

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.330
Thank goodness you're all right.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.580
Dad, what about everyone else?!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.700
Be quiet.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:17.370
Sorry.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:22.540
More importantly, who is this
strangely dressed lady?

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.540
Of course it'd bother you.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:32.910
My mom hasn't been able to rest
well lately, so she's been getting worse.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:35.290
That's why I...

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.290
Kai...

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.160
It can't be!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.160
Yeah, this person is an adventurer that came with me!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:47.370
This lady dressed in such a silly bear suit?

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:54.660
But they said they'd contact high-rank adventurers.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:58.790
Who knows if this village will last until then...

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.830
Hey, Kai.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:09.120
Elmina next door and Rond from the general
store tried to escape, and were eaten.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.250
N-No way!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:17.120
So, what is a low-ranked adventurer
doing here anyways?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.870
I'm here to collect information.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.200
Well. And take it down if I can.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.410
Take it down?!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.540
--Don't joke around!
--Dad!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.750
I'll be the one to decide if I can or not.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.080
Tell me what you know about the black viper.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.160
I understand.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:50.540
It pops up from nowhere,
slithers around town, and eats people.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:56.700
It responds to loud noises,
so it's hard to run away from it.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:01.410
Kai was only able to escape by sheer luck.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.410
So I'll be able to find its nest
if I follow the tracks it left behind.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.580
Got it. Thanks.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.000
I'm gonna take a look.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.120
Are you serious?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.950
Yeah.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.830
Oh, that's right.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:18.450
If things get bad, just use me as bait and run.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.370
I'm telling you, that's impossible.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.200
--It's impossible... Impossible...
--Dad...

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:37.830
Sis. I'm sorry about my dad.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.580
Everyone is at their limit.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.410
I'm not bothered by it.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.370
But--

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:49.830
I'd be worried if a girl dressed like a bear
responded to my cries for help, too.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.750
But Sis! You--

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:57.120
And, well, I want hardworking kids to be rewarded.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.950
Sis...

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.950
This must be the black viper's nest.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.290
Well. Go home for now, Kumayuru.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.500
Don't worry.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.330
Welp, let's go.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.410
That's as far as it goes.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.200
There's no place for such a big creature to hide here.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:52.250
Since I don't have any more clues,
I only have one option.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.250
Hm? Here?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.540
Found you!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.830
So big!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:13.370
I can see why the villagers gave up trying to escape.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.160
I'm sure you have your own reasons,

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.450
but I'm going to have to take you down.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.290
Oh, my.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.160
If fire doesn't work, how about this?

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.790
Thank goodness I have my bear equipment.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.330
Bear punch!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.330
If that's the case...

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:05.410
Oh, my. This didn't work, either.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.330
Shoot.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:13.250
Its power and speed are pretty formidable,
but the main problem is its skin.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.950
It deflects both physical and magical attacks.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:26.120
I think I can get past that snake skin
if I use my trump card,

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.830
but I'd like to bring home its parts.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.120
Well, during times like these,
we should follow basic theory.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.700
If we can't hurt it from the outside,
let's try from the inside!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.080
Wild instinct?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.660
Then, what about this?

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.830
You opened your mouth.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.910
You know, my magic...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.250
It gets more powerful
the more clearly I imagine <i>it</i>.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.000
Bear!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:23.540
Bear magic.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:26.410
Bear of Fire!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.120
Go!

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.410
Bear!

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.330
Bear!

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.750
Hunt complete.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.290
Now all that's left is...

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.540
Oh, Kai.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.870
What are you doing here?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:22.040
If you were being chased by the black viper,

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:25.200
I was thinking of being bait so you could escape!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.370
Huh? What?!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.580
What do you mean?

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:33.580
The information you bring may help
the adventurers beat the black viper.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.620
If that's the case, I should risk my life, too.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:41.250
The kids in this world brace themselves
for the worst too easily.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.580
It's okay.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.870
I defeated the black viper.

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:49.540
Huh?

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.120
Use that courage some other time.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.370
You defeated it?

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.750
Can you gather all the villagers?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:15:59.950
Uh, yeah.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.910
Miss Yuna, was it?

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.370
I'm the village chief, Zun.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:12.790
Did you really defeat the black viper?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.370
As you can see.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.870
Thank you very much!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.040
She did it! She did it!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.500
Thank you! Thank you so much!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.580
Dad. Mom. The adventurer avenged you for us.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:46.370
The village has been saved.
Everyone, enjoy this small celebration.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.950
A bear!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.830
Bear, did you defeat the big snake?

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:12.790
Rawr. I'm not a scary bear!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.700
Miss Bear!

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:24.830
See you later, Bear Sis!

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:25.830
Sis.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:35.450
I'm sorry, young lady.
Thank you for saving our village.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.700
It's fine.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:41.870
No one would think a bear girl
like this could defeat a black viper.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:47.160
You saved our lives. Please tell us if
there is ever anything we can do for you.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.580
Yeah. I'll depend on you if such a time comes.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.120
They're smiling while crying.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:12.450
The living have to live for the sake of those who died.

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:20.580
So we have to keep smiling no matter how
sad we are or how much we want to cry.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.250
If only I came a little sooner.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.450
That's not your fault, Sis!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:31.160
You listened to a kid like me and rushed
over here as quickly as you could...

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.080
Thanks.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.040
I've heard that cry before.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:59.950
I can't believe I got to taste something
so hard to find in Crimonia here!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.700
Eggs break easily, so it's hard to sell such things.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:11.910
There are wild kokekko near this village.

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.620
What kind of bird is a kokekko?

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:18.870
Unlike normal birds, it cannot fly high in the air.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:23.040
It makes nests on the ground
and cries out in the morning.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.910
That's just a normal chicken.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:30.500
If you like eggs that much, would you
like to take some home with you?

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:31.580
Really?!

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.910
Thank you, Sis.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:40.790
I want to become a strong bear like you someday!

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.910
The path of a bear is a thorny one.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.750
Stay healthy, Kai.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.950
Yeah! You too, Sis!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.040
See you again, Sis!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.580
I'm home!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:19:59.700
Miss Yuna.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.540
You're back already?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.410
Huh? Where are you going, Guild Master?

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:08.250
We weren't able to get a hold of
high-ranking adventurers...

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:13.500
So, I'm heading out there as the
guild master. I'd like any information--

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.750
Oh, I defeated it, so you don't
have to worry about it anymore.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.910
What?!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.660
Y-You shouldn't joke about things like that.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.500
I have the blessings of bears.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.160
I even have proof.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.330
Stop! Don't take it out here!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.120
The guild will get destroyed!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.370
You're absolutely right.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.040
You just went ahead to scout!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:39.330
Give up. Nothing she does surprises me anymore.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.160
As expected from the Bloody Bear.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:43.450
A black viper is nothing for her.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.160
As expected of Mr. Deborane's rival.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.870
Well, then. I've finished the quest.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.080
All right. Another perfect clear.

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:01.830
Let's take a small break...

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:07.080
Sell. Sell. Buy.

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:09.870
There. My accounts have increased again.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:11.790
"Grandpa"

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.700
What is it, Grandpa?

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.910
Yeah. I'm good.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.200
School?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:23.700
I keep telling you that I don't need to go.

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.660
Dad? Mom?

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:30.830
They wanted to go on vacation,
so I gave them some money.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.910
I'm sure they're probably playing around somewhere.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:43.160
Huh? Then I better come visit or you'll
stop being my co-signer for my apartment?!

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:45.950
Aww, jeez. Fine.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.160
See you.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.330
So troublesome.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:57.120
I guess I'll continue playing to change the mood.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:59.910
<i>World Fantasy Online</i>.

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:06.000
The first VRMMO fantasy RPG.

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:11.870
This is the world I currently live in!

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:49.950
"Next Episode"
"Bear, Meets Little Girl"
